<title>NEW ZEALAND: Advantage half yr profits slips 2.57 pct.</title>
<headline>Advantage half yr profits slips 2.57 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr to December 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  1.292 vs 1.326</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   6.46 vs 6.63</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    3.5 vs 3.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			     26.88 vs 26.22</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 2.01 vs 2.15</p>
<p>    Tax				     0.72 vs 0.83</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   20.00 vs same</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date April 24</p>
<p>Reg date April 18</p>
<p>    Ex div   April 21</p>
<p>Note - Advantage Group Ltd is a supplier of EFTPOS and card based computer systems.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
